---
title: "Required checks during wl finish"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Waiting for topic checks
  s1: Needs action before target push
  s2: Topic checks passed
  s3: Waiting for checks on pushed target
  s4: Needs action after target push
  s5: Integrated
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: required topic check fails or workflow cannot start
  s0 --> s2: required topic check passes
  s1 --> s0: finish a corrected topic commit
  s2 --> s3: push prepared commit to target
  s3 --> s4: required target check fails or workflow cannot start
  s3 --> s5: required target check passes
